1
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:14,360
(11:50-12:00 PM)

2
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:19,400
(11:50-12:00 PM)

3
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,820
♪Your silhouette melts into the glow♪

4
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,700
(Congrats to our grand prize winner!
Prize money: 100,000 yuan)

5
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:31,060
♪I count your sighs♪

6
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,800
♪Every breath♪

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,500
♪Feels like I'm stealing♪

8
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,990
♪The next second♪

9
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:44,220
♪Before it's no longer mine♪

10
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:50,020
♪We live♪
(Capernaum)

11
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:54,550
♪In the spaces between moments♪

12
00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:01,350
♪Breathing through each other's shadows♪

13
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:04,800
♪Let's not speak of what's to come♪

14
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:08,300
♪Or what came before♪

15
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:14,510
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪
(12:00-11:50 PM)

16
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,160
Tell me.

17
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:20,280
(Parallel Universe)
If I suddenly vanished one day...

18
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:27,760
And someone showed up
who looked just like me

19
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:30,800
but didn't have my consciousness...

20
00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,560
Would you still love me?

21
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:37,600
You're always
letting your imagination run wild.

22
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,920
Would you fall for someone

23
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,480
who looked nothing like me

24
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,440
but was really me?

25
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,600
As long as it's you,

26
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,320
I'll love you.

27
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,040
I always will.

28
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:59,700
=Thirteen Types of Love=
=Episode 1=

29
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:00,800
Zhang,

30
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,920
given Lin Duo's condition,

31
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:05,960
the chances of a cure are slim.

32
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:08,400
(Huaxia Delivery)
Doctor, I'll figure out the money.

33
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,640
Whatever it takes,

34
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:11,000
I have to save Lin Duo.

35
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:19,160
It's pouring out there today.

36
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:21,440
Babe,

37
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,280
it's pouring.

38
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,680
Why did you come here again?

39
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,120
I bought your favorite buns.

40
00:02:27,720 --> 00:02:29,120
I got there before they closed.

41
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:30,240
Look at you.

42
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,440
You're soaked.

43
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,640
I've made an appointment
at the marriage registry office.

44
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,280
Let me show you something.

45
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:45,720
I printed out the photos too.

46
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:46,640
We'll have the wedding

47
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,520
at that lakeside cabin

48
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,800
you love so much.

49
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,920
I got you a present.

50
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:56,720
You like it?

51
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,400
Now's the part

52
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:02,600
where I get a kiss.

53
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,080
Babe,

54
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,280
we don't have to

55
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,680
rush into getting married.

56
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,360
Duo,

57
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,400
we've known each other

58
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,560
since we were kids.

59
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,560
You still want to wait?

60
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,160
I...

61
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:27,360
I just want to get better first

62
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,840
so I can give you and our future
a real chance.

63
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,000
I...

64
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,040
Don't get all sentimental.

65
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:37,840
I want a hug.

66
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,800
Duo, I...

67
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,560
Hubby,

68
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:50,800
let's do this.

69
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,560
Let's get married tomorrow.

70
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,320
As soon as the sun comes up.

71
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,320
As soon as the rain stops.

72
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,280
(Kangaroo Delivery.)

73
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,240
(We've automatically accepted
a new order for you.)

74
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:13,080
Wifey,

75
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:13,840
I...

76
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,320
It's okay.

77
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:17,600
Go ahead.

78
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,480
Bye.

79
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:28,040
♪Let's not speak of what's to come
or what came before♪

80
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:33,520
♪This moment could last me a lifetime♪

81
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,120
The rain isn't going to stop.

82
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:44,720
(You're running out of time
on this order.)

83
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,200
(Please hurry with this delivery.)

84
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,600
Are you okay?

85
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:39,120
In this downpour,

86
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:41,400
two lives ended, one after the other.

87
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:46,000
But maybe in another world,

88
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,120
things could end differently.

89
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,240
If you're obsessed enough,

90
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:54,520
that obsession will create
a new parallel universe.

91
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,760
Zhang Yongsen,

92
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,840
I can cure the woman you love
of her terminal illness.

93
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:02,800
Are you willing to make a deal?

94
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:04,200
I am,

95
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,440
as long as you save her!

96
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:18,360
Welcome to the future.

97
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,400
Who are you?

98
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:23,480
What is this place?

99
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:24,920
I...

100
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,280
I can cure Lin Duo
of her terminal illness,

101
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:29,520
but you'll need to complete
a mission across universes.

102
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,480
What kind of mission?

103
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,640
This drug

104
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,840
can cure her for good.

105
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,640
It's called N9.

106
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,760
What will it cost me?

107
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:43,760
You need to travel to parallel universes
to save Lin Duo.

108
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,800
There are countless parallel universes

109
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:49,240
and countless versions of Lin Duo.

110
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:52,840
What the hell?

111
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,720
Every time you save
a Lin Duo in a parallel universe,

112
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:58,880
the Lin Duo in your world
will get a little better.

113
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:00,920
Here's the price.

114
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:02,640
Every time you succeed,

115
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,680
you'll lose a happy memory
you shared with her.

116
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,120
That's what

117
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,840
it'll cost you.

118
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:11,720
So,

119
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,520
will I forget her?

120
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,280
You'll remember her,

121
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,840
but the memories of your love

122
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,920
will fade bit by bit.

123
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:21,440
In those parallel universes,
Lin Duo doesn't know you.

124
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,440
She has to truly fall in love with you

125
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,040
for the rescue to count

126
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:26,720
and the drug to work.

127
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:27,760
If you fail the mission,

128
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:30,160
you'll vanish from every world for good.

129
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,120
Do you still want to save her?

130
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:33,920
(I do.)

131
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,880
(As long as I can save her.)

132
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:56,560
♪This is a story about you♪

133
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,540
♪Your name♪

134
00:08:02,030 --> 00:08:03,480
♪I've said it too many times♪

135
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,840
So what memories of Duo and me
will I lose?

136
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,200
That doesn't matter.

137
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,400
Just remember this.

138
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,000
Save another Lin Duo in another world,

139
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,560
and the woman you love can get better.

140
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,120
Remember,

141
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,680
she has to fall in love with you

142
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,040
for the drug to work.

143
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,800
That's the main rule.

144
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,040
Get this straight.

145
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,200
It has to be love.

146
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,800
Not pity.

147
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,720
Not gratitude.

148
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,200
All these universes

149
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:30,080
are things you imagined together.

150
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:32,000
The you and her in each one

151
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,240
are still you and her.

152
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,040
I'm her husband.

153
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:39,120
I can only love my own Lin Duo.

154
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,840
(Spacetime jump sequence initiated.)

155
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,000
(Launch imminent.)

156
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,360
(Destination: Universe D145.)

157
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,240
May you save her life

158
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,960
and hold on to the love you share.

159
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:50,000
Good luck, Mr. Zhang.

160
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:55,120
One, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

161
00:08:55,120 --> 00:09:00,120
Two, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

162
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:09,720
Three, two, three, four,
five, six, seven, eight.

163
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,880
Four, two, three, four...

164
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:13,600
That dream felt way too real.

165
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:19,320
This is my latest creation,

166
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,280
a drug that can cure any disease.

167
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,000
It's called N9.

168
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:35,760
(Inception)
You brat!

169
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:42,120
Look what we've got!

170
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,880
(Letter of Admission)
Your university acceptance letter!

171
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:47,320
You're majoring in photography,
you little punk!

172
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,960
You actually got in!

173
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,120
Uncle?

174
00:09:53,220 --> 00:09:55,100
(Letter of Admission)

175
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,360
You're still alive?

176
00:09:56,760 --> 00:09:57,280
Well,

177
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,600
should I drop dead?

178
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,200
It's real.

179
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:02,880
This isn't a dream.

180
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:05,960
This really isn't my universe.

181
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,640
It feels so real.

182
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:12,360
Thank you for raising me.

183
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:14,480
Thank you. Really.

184
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:19,040
Where are you going?

185
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,560
To find Lin Duo.

186
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:22,960
Lin Duo!

187
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:24,440
Lin Duo!

188
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,000
Lin Duo!

189
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,240
What do you want?

190
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,280
Who are you?

191
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,600
What are you doing?

192
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,280
What do you want at my place?

193
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:35,880
Lin Duo!

194
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,120
What do you want?

195
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:38,960
Who are you?

196
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,080
Who are you?

197
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:42,040
What do you want?

198
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,320
Who are you?

199
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,440
What are you up to?

200
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,840
You can't just show up
at someone's home.

201
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,600
Put that down!

202
00:10:51,760 --> 00:10:52,480
(Panic - Immersive Escape Rooms)
I said put it down!

203
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,800
(Does she work at an escape room now?)

204
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,360
(Panic - Immersive Escape Rooms
Flagship Store)

205
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:02,640
(Entrance)

206
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,400
Is Lin Duo...

207
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,160
Isn't she afraid of the dark?

208
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:37,080
Look, I need to see her. It's urgent.

209
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,200
Could you go get her for me?

210
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:39,920
This player's quitting.

211
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:41,760
Get the next player ready.

212
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,320
Is the Lin Duo in this universe

213
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,320
that brave?

214
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,800
Lin Duo?

215
00:12:20,490 --> 00:12:23,970
♪Does fate write every hello♪

216
00:12:23,970 --> 00:12:26,310
♪With a goodbye in mind?♪

217
00:12:31,950 --> 00:12:35,710
♪Does longing give us a beginning♪

218
00:12:35,710 --> 00:12:37,850
♪And leave us without an ending?♪

219
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:44,880
♪I remember♪

220
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:48,090
♪The way you breathe♪

221
00:12:49,590 --> 00:12:52,140
♪Countless versions of me♪

222
00:12:53,270 --> 00:12:54,980
♪All point♪

223
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:58,970
♪In the same direction♪

224
00:12:59,410 --> 00:13:03,020
♪Toward you♪

225
00:13:04,650 --> 00:13:06,480
♪I'll find you♪

226
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:09,060
♪In the silence as the world is reborn♪

227
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:12,170
♪I'll find you♪

228
00:13:12,170 --> 00:13:14,900
♪In the instant
before anything is decided♪

229
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:17,860
♪I'll find you♪

230
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:20,530
♪In the gaps
where time overlaps and slips♪

231
00:13:21,430 --> 00:13:23,310
♪I'll find you♪

232
00:13:27,490 --> 00:13:29,090
♪I'll find you♪

233
00:13:29,420 --> 00:13:32,060
♪In the promises left unsaid♪

234
00:13:32,850 --> 00:13:34,770
♪I'll find you♪

235
00:13:34,980 --> 00:13:37,690
♪In every pause between heartbeats♪

236
00:13:38,490 --> 00:13:40,500
♪I'll find you♪

237
00:13:40,670 --> 00:13:43,260
♪Where the last faint light fades♪

238
00:13:44,290 --> 00:13:46,610
♪I'll find you♪

239
00:13:49,990 --> 00:13:53,080
♪I'll find you♪
